msgid ""
"\n"
"IoT Box Homepage\n"
"================\n"
"\n"
"This module overrides Odoo web interface to display a simple\n"
"Homepage that explains what's the iotbox and shows the status,\n"
"and where to find documentation.\n"
"\n"
